  "title": "Ingevity’s Evotherm® P35 receives BASt approval in Germany",
  "summary": "Approval reflects alignment with evolving regulatory and performance standard for German market requirements NORTH CHARLESTON, S.C., July 16, 2026 – Ingevity Corporation (NYSE:NGVT) today announced Evotherm® P35 warm-mix additive has received approval from Germany’s Federal Highway Research Institute, known as BASt, for use in warm-mix asphalt applications. Approval signals that Evotherm® P35 meets the institute’s […]",
